## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router
- React 19 and TypeScript strict mode
- Tailwind CSS 4
- Lucide React and local SVG icon components
- Vercel deployment

## Commands

- `npm run dev` — start local development
- `npm run build` — create a production build
- `npm run lint` — run ESLint
- `npm run typecheck` — run TypeScript checks
- `npm run check` — run lint, typecheck, and build

## Project conventions

- Use named exports, PascalCase components, camelCase utilities, and two-space indentation.
- Prefer Tailwind utilities over inline styles.
- Keep components responsive and mobile-first.
- Store localized portfolio content in `src/data/portfolio.ts`.
- Keep language support ordered as English, Japanese, and Vietnamese, with English as the default.
- Preserve both light and dark theme behavior when changing visual assets.
- Use real portfolio content and project-local assets; do not add placeholders or template branding.
- Before removing an asset or component, verify it is no longer referenced.
